WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.255 --> 00:00:06.298
Leanne?

00:00:06.381 --> 00:00:07.633
Hello, Mrs. Turner.

00:00:09.384 --> 00:00:10.719
I guess we should talk about this.

00:00:13.639 --> 00:00:16.850
We lost Jericho
when he was… 13 weeks.

00:00:17.601 --> 00:00:18.727
Dorothy took it hard.

00:00:19.478 --> 00:00:21.313
This is the only thing
that brought her back.

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:24.107
Any questions?

00:00:24.191 --> 00:00:25.734
No, Mr. Turner.

00:00:30.948 --> 00:00:32.324
Whose baby is that?

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:35.244
Did I do something wrong?

00:00:35.661 --> 00:00:40.040
Do you know who
you welcomed into your home?

00:00:44.962 --> 00:00:46.672
Why haven't you told her what she did?

00:00:58.433 --> 00:00:59.977
We have to protect ourselves.

00:01:01.228 --> 00:01:03.188
You have to understand.

00:01:03.272 --> 00:01:05.482
For Jericho,
there's nothing I wouldn't do.

00:01:05.566 --> 00:01:06.400
Nothing!

00:01:08.026 --> 00:01:10.404
I think it would be best if you were able
to make peace with Leanne.

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:12.739
Why are you all so afraid of her?

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:15.325
I don't know why I keep doing bad things.

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:19.121
I can feel the dark thing in me
getting bigger.

00:01:19.955 --> 00:01:21.665
I know they're coming for me.

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:24.376
I'll be ready.

00:01:27.671 --> 00:01:29.631
She grows stronger each night.

00:01:30.382 --> 00:01:32.759
The house is filled with parasites.

00:01:34.553 --> 00:01:36.054
Do you smell the rot?

00:01:42.519 --> 00:01:44.271
What the hell happens now?

00:01:47.065 --> 00:01:48.358
The end.

00:01:50.694 --> 00:01:52.362
You can feel it now, can't you?

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:55.365
It's her power.

00:01:56.533 --> 00:01:57.868
There's a war afoot.

00:02:04.374 --> 00:02:08.378
And there's nothing that any of you
can do to stop me.

